  "description": "Sauna85 Ltd proposes a temporary, small-scale outdoor wellness facility on the forecourt of Action House, 53 Sandgate Street, SE15 1LE. The installation includes a prefabricated indoor sauna, three plunge baths, four outdoor showers, changing cabins, and relevant supporting infrastructure. The proposed structures are single-storey and low lying, of a modest scale and unobtrusive appearance. Designed as a meanwhile use, the facility activates an underused site while preserving its long-term redevelopment potential. Sessions are open to the public via advance booking. The proposal supports community wellbeing, helps combat social isolation, and creates flexible employment opportunities for up to 20 local residents.",
